    "text": "BREAK LOG, CROSSING FOUR\nNothing to report. Nothing to report. Nothing to\nreport. Relief crew: bring cards.\n[later, different hand]\nSomething to report. See crossing one. Do not\nlinger here either, just in case whatever's wrong\nwith one isn't done counting."
